  { "NOTE", 0, "Warrior at 20: Speak with Ruga starts in Orgrimmar (Sorek, Valley of Honor) or Thunder Bluff (Torm Ragetotem, Hunter Rise) and sends you back to Ruga Ragetotem here in Camp Taurajo for the Brutal Armor chain.", "", class = "WARRIOR" },
  { "NOTE", 0, "Priest at 20: Shadowguard is a quest from Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits; take it on your next trip.", "", class = "PRIEST" },
  { "NOTE", 0, "Druid at 20: Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff starts The Great Cat Spirit (new in Forever), a Moonglade trip that ends at the Great Cat Spirit in the south of Moonglade. Aquatic Form (A Lesson to Learn, 16) is a long trip to Silverpine and Darkshore; do it when you pass through.", "", class = "DRUID" },
  { "NOTE", 0, "Level 20: train Aspect of the Cheetah (hunter), Demon Armor (warlock), Ghost Wolf (shaman), Flash Heal and Mind Flay (priest), Cleave and Slam (warrior) or Cat Form (druid) and head for Stonetalon or Ashenvale. The route ends here.", "" },
